<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Nggunakake Variabel lan Simbol Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1171789687379"><newline /></para>
<para id="fs-id1170655208137">Nalika rong besaran nduweni nilai sing padha, loro-lorone diarani padha lan disambungake nganggo <term id="term-00010">tandha padha karo</term>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655025665">
<title>Simbol Padha Karo</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654990403"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> padha karo <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis>”</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655126926">Simbol <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>“=”</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> diarani <emphasis effect="bold">tandha padha karo</emphasis>.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655108736">Ing garis wilangan, nilai wilangan saya gedhé saka kiwa menyang tengen. Garis wilangan bisa digunakake kanggo njlentrehake simbol “&lt;” lan “&gt;”.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655207857">
<title>Pertidaksamaan</title>
<equation id="fs-id1167270244162" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr /><m:mtr /><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>diwaca “</m:mtext><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>luwih cilik tinimbang</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mtext>”</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>mapan ing sisih kiwa</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>ing garis wilangan</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<media id="fs-id1170652623871" alt="Garis wilangan kanthi titik a ing sisih kiwa titik b.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_001_img_new.jpg" />
</media>
<equation id="fs-id1167269909313" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>diwaca “</m:mtext><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>luwih gedhé tinimbang</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mtext>”</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>mapan ing sisih tengen</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>ing garis wilangan</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<media id="fs-id1167269961954" alt="Garis wilangan kanthi titik b ing sisih kiwa titik a.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_002_img_new.jpg" />
</media>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655155145">Ekspresi <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &lt; b utawa a &gt; <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> bisa diwaca saka kiwa menyang tengen utawa saka tengen menyang kiwa, sanajan lumrahe diwaca saka kiwa menyang tengen (<link target-id="fs-id1170655178120" />). Umume, <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &lt; b padha tegese karo b &gt; <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>. Tuladhane, 7 &lt; 11 padha tegese karo 11 &gt; 7. Mangkono uga, <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &gt; <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> padha tegese karo <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> &lt; a. Tuladhane, 17 &gt; 4 padha tegese karo 4 &lt; 17.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655178120" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni enem larik lan rong kolom. Larik kapisan minangka larik irah-irahan kanggo saben kolom. Irah-irahan kolom kapisan yaiku “Simbol Pertidaksamaan” lan kolom kapindho “Tembung”. Ing kolom “Simbol Pertidaksamaan” ana notasi: a, tandha ora padha karo, b; a, tandha luwih cilik tinimbang, b; a, tandha luwih cilik utawa padha karo, b; a, tandha luwih gedhé tinimbang, b; a, tandha luwih gedhé utawa padha karo, b. Ing kolom “Tembung” ana frasa: “a ora padha karo b”, “a luwih cilik tinimbang b”, “a luwih cilik utawa padha karo b”, “a luwih gedhé tinimbang b”, lan “a luwih gedhé utawa padha karo b”.">
<label />
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Simbol Pertidaksamaan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Tembung</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">ora padha karo</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &lt; <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih cilik tinimbang</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih cilik utawa padha karo</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a &gt; b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih gedhé tinimbang</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≥</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih gedhé utawa padha karo</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1170655113222">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654999980">
<problem id="fs-id1170655020482">
<para id="fs-id1170654984453">Owahana saka aljabar dadi ukara basa Jawa; bandhingna karo sumber basa Indonesia:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654989586"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655105413">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1166424795899"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline />
17 luwih cilik utawa padha karo 26<newline /><newline />
<span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline />
8 ora padha karo 17 dikurangi 3<newline /><newline />
<span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline />
12 luwih gedhé tinimbang 27 dipara 3<newline /><newline />
<span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline />
<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> ditambah 7 luwih cilik tinimbang 19</para></solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654935250" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655166352">
<problem id="fs-id1170654985390">
<para id="fs-id1170654943066">Owahana saka aljabar dadi ukara basa Jawa; bandhingna karo sumber basa Indonesia:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655190264"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654943209">
<para id="fs-id1170655353526"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 14 luwih cilik utawa padha karo 27 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 19 dikurangi 2 ora padha karo 8 <span class="token">ⓒ</span> 12 luwih gedhé tinimbang 4 dipara 2 <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dikurangi 7 luwih cilik tinimbang 1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655124058" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655205783">
<problem id="fs-id1170655166119">
<para id="fs-id1170655203511">Owahana saka aljabar dadi ukara basa Jawa; bandhingna karo sumber basa Indonesia:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655174550"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>≥</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655192260">
<para id="fs-id1170655222902"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 19 luwih gedhé utawa padha karo 15 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 7 padha karo 12 dikurangi 5 <span class="token">ⓒ</span> 15 dipara 3 luwih cilik tinimbang 8 <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> ditambah 3 luwih gedhé tinimbang 6</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>
